==English==

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

{{label|en|idiomatic}} {{alternative spelling of|tits-up|lang=en}}

Definition: TITSUP (or titsup) is an [[acronym]] that stands for "Total Inability To Support Usual Performance." Often used to indicate a website or service that is temporarily unavailable.

* '''2004''', Karen Traviss, ''Crossing the Line'', HarperCollins, page 237: We can't extract you if it all goes '''titsup'''.
* [http://www.theregister.co.uk/2016/01/19/twitter_is_down/ Twitter goes titsup]
* [http://www.theregister.co.uk/2015/12/09/snapchat_titsup_on_heels_of_google_app_engine_outage/ Snapchat TITSUP on heels of Google App Engine outage]